  "identity": "An inward three-quarter piano miniature: the old descending sigh becomes exposed E-C and B-G-sharp questions, separated by unequal silences. Three-bar thoughts leave a whole bar unanswered; a five-bar reply arrives without a swell. Tiny late ornaments interrupt rather than fill the quiet. Peak is a softer, fragile high-register recollection, never an energy climax. Upper notes are optional isolated echoes, not a sustained layer; final A releases before the last beat.",
